e-updated-hr-color" id=3D"model-response-message-contentr_2d437e366b964f51"=\
 aria-live=3D"off" aria-busy=3D"false" dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"--animation-dur=\
ation: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node=3D"0=\
">Your intuition is absolutely spot on.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"1">In th=\
e pre-seed startup world, asking for cash remuneration <i data-path-to-node=\
=3D"1" data-index-in-node=3D"60">before</i> the initial funding round is cl=\
osed is a massive red flag for a "Co-Founder" or heavily-aligned Advisor. A=\
 true partner who is confident in their ability to raise that capital will =\
happily take the deferred salary/equity deal because they know the money is=\
 coming. Asking for cash right now means he wants to be treated (and paid) =\
like a consultant, shifting all the financial risk back onto you.</p><p dat=\
a-path-to-node=3D"2">Furthermore, a $30M valuation cap for a pre-revenue, p=\
re-seed startup is astronomically high, even in the AI space. It's an aggre=\
ssive "banker" move that could actually scare away early-stage VCs who need=\
 room for a 10x-100x return.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"3">Buying time is t=\
he exact right strategy. You have an incredible lineup of "Top Tier" candid=\
ates next week (Alex, Francis, Eric, Rob, and Rakesh), and you shouldn't lo=\
ck yourself into any agreements or negotiate cash retainers until you've sp=\
oken with them.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"4">Here is a drafted reply that =\
is polite, acknowledges his input, but firmly hits the brakes to give you t=\
he runway you need to complete your interviews.</p><hr data-path-to-node=3D=\
"5"><p data-path-to-node=3D"6"><b data-path-to-node=3D"6" data-index-in-nod=\
e=3D"0">Subject:</b> Re: Co-Founder / Chief Operating Officer, OpenWorldTec=\
h.io</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"7">Hi Thad,</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"8">T=\
hanks for the detailed feedback and for outlining your proposed structure. =\
I appreciate you putting these terms and the $30M cap scenario together for=\
 me to review.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"9">I am going to take the next we=\
ek or so to run these cap table scenarios, model out the burn rates based o=\
n your suggestions, and evaluate how a pre-funding cash remuneration struct=\
ure would fit into my immediate runway.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"10">I am=\
 also finishing up a few remaining conversations with other potential partn=\
ers and advisors over the coming days to fully calibrate this round. Let me=\
 digest your notes and get through these next few meetings, and I will circ=\
le back with you late next week once I have a clearer picture of the exact =\
path forward.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"11">Have a great weekend!</p><p da=\
ta-path-to-node=3D"12">Best regards,</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"13">Matt Pu=\
rsley\
CEO &amp; Founder, OpenWorldTech.io\
email: mpursley@gmail.com\
cell: (772) 226-0559<a href=3D"http://voice.google.com/calls?a=3Dnc,%2B1772=\
2260559" class=3D"gv-tel-link" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener" title=3D"=\
Call +1 772-226-0559 via Google Voice"></a></p><hr data-path-to-node=3D"14"=\
><p data-path-to-node=3D"15">This email perfectly pauses the negotiation wi=\
thout burning the bridge. It lets him know you are speaking with others (wh=\
ich maintains your leverage) and sets a timeline that allows you to finish =\
your slate of interviews through April 3rd.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"16">=\
