ies A at a $100M valuation within 12-18 months is exactly the trajectory I =\
want to target.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"7">Per your request, I=E2=80=99v=\
e put together a high-level term sheet outlining the two paths we discussed=\
. To ensure we have the runway needed to execute this buildout, my core ope=\
rational principle is that all cash remuneration (salaries or retainers) tr=\
iggers strictly upon the successful deposit of the $3M pre-seed round, with=\
 final figures aligning with the lead investor=E2=80=99s approved "Use of P=\
roceeds."</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"8">Here is how I envision the staged a=\
