rldTech.io</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"3">Hi Thad,</p><p data-path-to-node=\
=3D"4">Thanks for getting back to me.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"5">Path A =\
sounds like the perfect fit. Given your active involvement with your other =\
portfolio companies, the Founding Advisor &amp; Board Member role is a smar=\
t way to leverage your strategic guidance and network without overextending=\
 your bandwidth.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"6">The 2% equity grant and the =\
post-funding monthly cash stipend sound like a reasonable starting point. F=\
eel free to put together that short agreement and send it over so I can rev=\
iew the proposed terms. Just to ensure we keep the cap table clean and inve=\
stor-ready, please make sure the draft reflects the standard 3-year monthly=\
 vesting schedule with the 1-year cliff and double-trigger acceleration tha=\
t we discussed.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"7">Once we get the details irone=\
d out and executed, I'm looking forward to diving right into tightening up =\
the pitch deck, running the cap table scenarios, and mapping out our initia=\
l fundraising targets.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"8">Best regards,</p><p da=\
